# A page object: what can be done on the shop's first page, as blocks a hunt
# borrows by name.
#
#     @import: Open the shop, Add the product from '../pages/shop.hunt'
#     ...
#     USE Open the shop
#
# A block is run with the variables of the hunt that uses it. {shop} comes
# from the hook script; {product} is set by the hunt, or by its loop.
# This file is not a hunt to run on its own.

@context: Page object: the shop's catalogue
@title: Page - Shop

STEP 1: Open the shop
    NAVIGATE to {shop}/index.html
    VERIFY that 'Steppe Goods' is present

STEP 2: Add the product
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR '{product}'
    VERIFY that '{product} added to cart' is present

STEP 3: Open the cart
    CLICK the 'Cart' button
    VERIFY that 'Your cart' is present
DONE.
